BlueShip: Bluetooth Simplified High-level Interface for Peripherals

Supported profiles:
	Audio: Interface for interacting with audio servers
	Manager: Interface for controlling the server, which is also
		capable configuring the peripherals, including
		IO-Capability, device type, etc.
